# Splice Bots slice 1 from the title to SCENE RESTORED, through the host interface, on the world
# `splice-bots` as the jam build bakes it in (splice-export WORLD_DIR). Walking between beats is stood in
# for by msg 611 (place, centimetres) and 643 (at a weak point). Facts: 0 mode, 1 zone, 2 phase,
# 3 hearts, 4 Heat, 5 robot pieces, 6 cells, 7 rubble gone, 8 boss wall gone, 9 boss down, 11.. a part
# or card held (11 arm, 12 treads, 13 battery, 14 MOVE, 15 DRILL, 16 DRILL+, 17 the core).
size 1280 800
frames 2 20
beat title
expect 0 0
# NEW RUN, then USE THIS CHARACTER on the creation screen: the solar farm by day
key -2
expect 0 7
key -2
expect 0 1
expect 2 1
beat farm
# the farm: Digger picks up the four parts by his sensor as you walk near each
msg 611 -83800 -10900
frames 150 20
msg 611 -84300 -10500
frames 150 20
msg 611 -80900 -9300
frames 150 20
msg 611 -81500 -8900
frames 150 20
expect 11 1
expect 12 1
expect 14 1
expect 15 1
expect 13 1
# E at the rover: into its room; Tab, the edit bay: the parts and the MOVE and DRILL cards; Tab out
msg 611 -76500 -12800
frames 5 20
key e
key e up
frames 5 20
key -15
expect 0 2
beat bay
key 4
key 5
key 6
key 1
key 2
key -15
frames 5 20
expect 0 1
# E at the desk: she takes Sniper's wheel; the run puts Sniper at the garage's parking (on the drive 611 places
# the rover), it is dusk in the garage yard, and E parks it and lets her out
msg 611 -49770 75725
frames 2 20
# Sniper puts the deep-garage map up the first time at the desk: E closes it, and E again (at the desk) takes the wheel
key e
key e up
frames 2 20
expect 0 1
msg 611 -49770 75725
key e
key e up
frames 5 20
expect 0 9
frames 100 20
beat drive
msg 611 600 500
frames 20 20
key e
key e up
frames 5 20
expect 0 1
expect 2 2
beat garage
# a click on the rubble: Digger drills it
msg 611 0 -2800
frames 2 20
click 640 400
frames 1500 20
expect 7 1
# a battery cell (the DRILL+ in the vault is no step of the run: Digger's DRILL already drills)
msg 611 -3731 -5304
frames 200 20
expect 6 1
beat garage-parts
# the drill mech in the empty section C1: Digger's core in (E); it follows her to the blocked hallway and drills it
# on its own once there. No E there: with the hallway open, E beside the mech takes the core back out
msg 611 14700 -19500
frames 2 20
key e
key e up
frames 5 20
msg 611 100 -34800
frames 2000 20
expect 8 1
beat wall-open
# the boss: the mech battles it with keys 1 to 4; while it reels, F stuns its three weak points
msg 611 150 -35400
frames 10 20
key 1
key 2
key 3
key 4
msg 643 0
key f
msg 643 1
key f
msg 643 2
key f
