beat boss-down
# its banned core (under its chest, wherever it fell: 643 0 stands her at its neck, over it), then the edit bay at
# Sniper: SPLICE CORE plays the memory, then SCENE RESTORED
msg 643 0
frames 2 20
key e
key e up
frames 5 20
expect 17 1
msg 611 300 500
frames 2 20
key -15
expect 0 2
key x
frames 3 20
expect 0 4
beat memory
